hard_gates.evidence:
Browser walk (walks/walk2.txt, screenshots 02, 04 and 05). A user created by keyboard with the Read-only role (Alt+N, 'read' Enter, Ctrl+Enter) signs in with the set-up code and chooses a password. Then:
- they see no New user, and Alt+N opens nothing;
- the palette offers nothing for 'new';
- a user record shows only Close, with read-only fields;
- POST /api/identity/users and POST /api/identity/roles answer 403.
The G2 suites in verify passed.
